    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余念（23）：强忍悲戚.png",
    "lines": [
      "“终于收完了！我还以为真要收出十箱八箱呢。……也好，东西少，走起来省事。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D002": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": false,
    "speaker": "余念·独白",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余念（23）：烦躁郁闷.png",
    "lines": [
      "“我就知道，她到底什么时候进来的……每次都这样，也不先问我一声。算了，药先放着吧。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D003": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": false,
    "speaker": "余念·独白",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余念（23）：正常状态.png",
    "lines": [
      "“总算等到这一天了。……怎么还真有点紧张……没事，到了再说！”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D004": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": false,
    "speaker": "余念·独白",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余念（23）：欣然愉悦.png",
    "lines": [
      "“看着还行嘛。至少不像第一次出远门的人。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D041": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": false,
    "speaker": "余念·独白",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余念（23）：欣然愉悦.png",
    "lines": [
      "“我就说没丢嘛。妈前两天还让我别找了，再买一副。幸好没听她的。……这种地方也就我进得来，要换成她，腰肯定不行。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D042": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": false,
    "speaker": "余念·独白",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余念（23）：欣然愉悦.png",
    "lines": [
      "“妈以前头发这么长啊。……她现在拍照还老说自己不上镜，明明这张倒笑得挺开心的。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D043": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": false,
    "speaker": "余念·独白",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余念（23）：强忍悲戚.png",
    "lines": [
      "“爸爸的衣服……还留着。每次收拾都说‘下回再弄’，下回又原样挂回去。……算了，她想留就留吧。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D044": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": false,
    "speaker": "余念·独白",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余念（23）：欣然愉悦.png",
    "lines": [
      "“这东西居然还没散架。不过，换根线，应该也还能戴。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D005": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": true,
    "speaker": "余秀兰",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余秀兰（48）：欣然愉悦.png",
    "lines": [
      "“雨伞没拿，来，给你装上。你这拉链怎么又卡了？”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D006": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": true,
    "speaker": "余秀兰",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余秀兰（48）：满眼宠溺.png",
    "lines": [
      "“那边这两天有雨。塞着吧，省得到地方现买。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D007": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": true,
    "speaker": "余念",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余念（23）：烦躁郁闷.png",
    "lines": [
      "“妈，真塞不下了，你别硬塞啊。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D008": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": true,
    "speaker": "余念",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余念（23）：正常状态.png",
    "lines": [
      "“到那儿再买就行，便利店多的是。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D009": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": true,
    "speaker": "余秀兰",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余秀兰（48）：正常状态.png",
    "lines": [
      "“十几二十块不是钱啊？家里有，还买。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D010": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": true,
    "speaker": "余秀兰",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余秀兰（48）：满眼宠溺.png",
    "lines": [
      "“还有这两盒药你别给我拿出来，啊，你一忙起来，饭都不按点吃。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D011": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": true,
    "speaker": "余秀兰",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余秀兰（48）：强忍悲戚.png",
    "lines": [
      "“你说你……非得跑那么远干什么。省城不是也有工作吗？”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D012": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": true,
    "speaker": "余念",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余念（23）：烦躁郁闷.png",
    "lines": [
      "“妈，你说，这伞都多少年了，骨架都松了，我带它干什么。”"
    ],
    "next": "END"
  },
  "D013": {
    "mode": "dialogue",
    "blocking": true,
    "speaker": "余秀兰",
    "portrait": "res://art/portraits/chapter1/余秀兰（48）：强忍悲戚.png",
    "lines": [
